@base = http://localhost:3000

### ===== AULAS =====

### 1. Listar aulas -> 200
GET {{base}}/aula

### 2. Cadastrar aula -> 201
POST {{base}}/aula
Content-Type: application/json

{ "componente": "História" }

### 3. Cadastrar aula sem nome -> 400
POST {{base}}/aula
Content-Type: application/json

{ "componente": "" }

### ===== HORÁRIOS =====

### 4. POST /horario com aula inexistente -> 404 (chave estrangeira)
POST {{base}}/horario
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dia": "segunda", "hora": "07:20", "aula_id": 9999 }

### 5. POST /horario válido -> 201
POST {{base}}/horario
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dia": "segunda", "hora": "07:20", "aula_id": 1 }

### 6. POST /horario repetido (mesmo dia e hora) -> 409
POST {{base}}/horario
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dia": "segunda", "hora": "07:20", "aula_id": 2 }

### 7. POST /horario com dia inválido -> 400
POST {{base}}/horario
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dia": "domingo", "hora": "07:20", "aula_id": 1 }

### 8. POST /horario sem campos -> 400
POST {{base}}/horario
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dia": "segunda" }

### 9. GET /horario/segunda -> 200 com a lista
GET {{base}}/horario/segunda

### 10. GET /horario/domingo -> 400
GET {{base}}/horario/domingo

### ===== EXCLUSÕES =====

### 11. DELETE /aula/1 com horário vinculado -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/aula/1

### 12. DELETE /horario/1 -> 200 (troque o 1 pelo id retornado no teste 5)
DELETE {{base}}/horario/1

### 13. DELETE /horario/1 de novo -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/horario/1

### 14. DELETE /aula/1 agora sem horários -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/aula/1

### 15. DELETE /aula/9999 -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/aula/9999

### 16. DELETE /aula/abc -> 400
DELETE {{base}}/aula/abc